{"id":"ocho","lemma":"ocho","pos":"noun","rank":629,"glosses":["eight","figure of eight (knot)","butthole; anus"],"ipa":"/ˈot͡ʃo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ochos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ocho.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ven a mi casa a las ocho.","en":"Come to my house at eight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1155878","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Estaré en tu casa a las ocho.","en":"I will be at your house at eight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693301","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Mi hija duerme ocho horas al día.","en":"My daughter sleeps eight hours a day.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689385","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"daughter"},{"g":"to sleep","l":"dormir"},null,{"g":"hour","l":"hora"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"per day"]]},{"text":"Él tiene ocho años.","en":"He is eight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/40566","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"year","l":"año"}]},{"text":"Cinco es menos que ocho.","en":"5 is less than 8.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636457","words":[{"g":"a five"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"less, fewer"},{"g":"that"},null]}]}